  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation for the establishment of a TRC in Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A seven-person Technical Committee will prepare the work of a Truth and Reconciliation Commission under a 3 month mandate. The Committee is expected to produce a draft legislation in respect of the TRC as well as draft budget for this process.</narrative>
  </description>
